 "sentences": [
  "Meet the bizarre gasteroid agaricus fungus!",
  "Fruit bodies reach heights of 18 cm tall.",
  "The tough woody stems thicken towards the base.",
  "It was moved to the genus Agaricus in 2004.",
  "Unlike other Agaricus species, it does not develop true gills.",
  "Spores grow inside a convoluted tissue called a gleba.",
  "Splits in the cap expose the blackish-brown gleba for dispersal."
